{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"effectBgBlur"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic06EffectB5Tokena","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EffectSemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebarcomponenttokensprovider\/effectbgblur"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token EffectRawTokens.blur320 (= 32)","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider\/effectBgBlur","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effectBgBlur","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EffectSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic06EffectB5Tokena"}],"extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","title":"effectBgBlur","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B31ThemeBarComponentTokensProviderC12effectBgBlur14CoreFoundation7CGFloatVvp","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider"]]},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","title":"Theme Orange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebarcomponenttokensprovider","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of bar","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBarComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BarComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bar","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Bar","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProviders"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and effects (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllEffectSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider/effectBgBlur":{"title":"effectBgBlur","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider\/effectBgBlur","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebarcomponenttokensprovider\/effectbgblur","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token EffectRawTokens.blur320 (= 32)"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effectBgBlur","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic06EffectB5Tokena","text":"EffectSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null,"type